D11 appearance-policy for whip_core 1.0.1, used by d11_stores (whip-d11-clothing). LGPL-3.0, as whip_core.
The character editor as a store: only the tabs the store unlocks, a cart on the right (a line per item, x to put it
back, cash or bank), the server checks and charges before it keeps the look; the editor camera stops at walls.
Not needed on whip_core 1.2.0 or newer: d11_stores uses its own store checkout (EditAppearance) there.
Apply in resources/: patch -p1 < whip_core-appearance-policy-1.0.1.patch   (back up whip_core first; restart whip_core after)

